@gentlementlegen 
It was implied that you were supposed to invert the logic. Read the property name carefully and you'll see that it's saying only team members can invoke permit generation
```json
{
         "collaboratorOnlyPaymentInvocation": {
            "default": false,
            "description": "If true, will allow contributors to generate permits.",
            "type": "boolean"
}
```

